      "Wrap the rabbit strip forward in touching turns, stroking the fur back on every turn so none traps under the hide, and tie off behind the eyes.",
      "Lay a few strands of black holographic Flashabou along each side, reaching to the tips of the tail fur.",
      "Tie in a schlappen feather by the tip and take two or three turns to form a soft collar, then sweep the fibres back with a couple of thread wraps.",
