      "Tie in the chartreuse bucktail on top of the flash, tips even with the belly, using two loose gathering wraps and then tight ones so the hair stays on top and does not flare.",
      "Trim the butts on a taper, cover them with a neat cone-shaped head and, if you like, add a band of chartreuse thread at the nose.",
